{"id":324,"slug":"324-union-types-va-intersection-types-la-gi","category":"TypeScript","subcategory":"Types Nhập Môn","level":"beginner","question_vi":"Union types và intersection types là gì?","question_en":"What are union types and intersection types?","answer_vi":"`A | B` là **hoặc**, `A & B` là **và**.\n\n```typescript\ntype Id = string | number            // union: một trong hai\ntype Admin = User & { role: 'admin' } // intersection: có đủ cả hai\n```\n\nĐiểm hay nhầm — **union thu hẹp cái dùng được, intersection mở rộng**:\n\n```typescript\ntype A = { a: string; shared: string }\ntype B = { b: number; shared: string }\n\nconst u: A | B = getSomething()\nu.shared    // OK — thuộc tính CHUNG mới truy cập được\nu.a         // Lỗi: không chắc là A hay B\n\nconst i: A & B = { a: 'x', b: 1, shared: 's' }\ni.a; i.b    // OK — có tất cả\n```\n\nMuốn dùng thuộc tính riêng của union thì phải thu hẹp kiểu trước (`typeof`, `in`, discriminated union).\n\nHai đặc điểm của intersection hay bị hỏi:\n\n```typescript\ntype Never = string & number      // never — không giá trị nào vừa là string vừa là number\n\ntype C = { x: string } & { x: number }\n// x có kiểu never — không thể tạo được object hợp lệ\n```\n\n**Lưu ý:** intersection nhiều interface lớn khiến thông báo lỗi của TypeScript rất dài và khó đọc. Khi mô tả \"đối tượng có thêm thuộc tính\", `interface X extends Y` cho thông báo lỗi rõ hơn `type X = Y & {...}`","answer_en":"`A | B` means **or**, `A & B` means **and**.\n\n```typescript\ntype Id = string | number            // union: one of the two\ntype Admin = User & { role: 'admin' } // intersection: both at once\n```\n\nThe common confusion — **unions narrow what you may use, intersections widen it**:\n\n```typescript\ntype A = { a: string; shared: string }\ntype B = { b: number; shared: string }\n\nconst u: A | B = getSomething()\nu.shared    // OK — only the COMMON property is reachable\nu.a         // Error: it may be A or B\n\nconst i: A & B = { a: 'x', b: 1, shared: 's' }\ni.a; i.b    // OK — everything is present\n```\n\nTo reach a union member's own property you must narrow first (`typeof`, `in`, a discriminated union).\n\nTwo intersection traits interviewers probe:\n\n```typescript\ntype Never = string & number      // never — nothing is both a string and a number\n\ntype C = { x: string } & { x: number }\n// x is never — no valid object can be built\n```\n\n**Practical pitfall:** intersecting several large interfaces makes TypeScript's error messages long and hard to read. When you mean \"this object plus some fields\", `interface X extends Y` gives clearer errors than `type X = Y & {...}`","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>A | B</code> là <strong>hoặc</strong>, <code>A &amp; B</code> là <strong>và</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type Id = string | number            // union: một trong hai\ntype Admin = User &amp; { role: 'admin' } // intersection: có đủ cả hai\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Id</span> = <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> | <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>            <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// union: một trong hai</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Admin</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span> &amp; { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;admin&#x27;</span> } <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// intersection: có đủ cả hai</span></code></pre></div><p>Điểm hay nhầm — <strong>union thu hẹp cái dùng được, intersection mở rộng</strong>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type A = { a: string; shared: string }\ntype B = { b: number; shared: string }\n\nconst u: A | B = getSomething()\nu.shared    // OK — thuộc tính CHUNG mới truy cập được\nu.a         // Lỗi: không chắc là A hay B\n\nconst i: A &amp; B = { a: 'x', b: 1, shared: 's' }\ni.a; i.b    // OK — có tất cả\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> A = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">a</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attr\">shared</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> }\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> B = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">b</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attr\">shared</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">u</span>: A | B = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getSomething</span>()\nu.<span class=\"hljs-property\">shared</span>    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// OK — thuộc tính CHUNG mới truy cập được</span>\nu.<span class=\"hljs-property\">a</span>         <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Lỗi: không chắc là A hay B</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">i</span>: A &amp; B = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">a</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;x&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">b</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">shared</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;s&#x27;</span> }\ni.<span class=\"hljs-property\">a</span>; i.<span class=\"hljs-property\">b</span>    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// OK — có tất cả</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Muốn dùng thuộc tính riêng của union thì phải thu hẹp kiểu trước (<code>typeof</code>, <code>in</code>, discriminated union).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Hai đặc điểm của intersection hay bị hỏi:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type Never = string &amp; number      // never — không giá trị nào vừa là string vừa là number\n\ntype C = { x: string } &amp; { x: number }\n// x có kiểu never — không thể tạo được object hợp lệ\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Never</span> = <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> &amp; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// never — không giá trị nào vừa là string vừa là number</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> C = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">x</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> } &amp; { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">x</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span> }\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// x có kiểu never — không thể tạo được object hợp lệ</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> intersection nhiều interface lớn khiến thông báo lỗi của TypeScript rất dài và khó đọc.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Khi mô tả \"đối tượng có thêm thuộc tính\", <code>interface X extends Y</code> cho thông báo lỗi rõ hơn <code>type X = Y &amp; {...}</code>.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>A | B</code> means <strong>or</strong>, <code>A &amp; B</code> means <strong>and</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type Id = string | number            // union: one of the two\ntype Admin = User &amp; { role: 'admin' } // intersection: both at once\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Id</span> = <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> | <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>            <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// union: one of the two</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Admin</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span> &amp; { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;admin&#x27;</span> } <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// intersection: both at once</span></code></pre></div><p>The common confusion — <strong>unions narrow what you may use, intersections widen it</strong>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type A = { a: string; shared: string }\ntype B = { b: number; shared: string }\n\nconst u: A | B = getSomething()\nu.shared    // OK — only the COMMON property is reachable\nu.a         // Error: it may be A or B\n\nconst i: A &amp; B = { a: 'x', b: 1, shared: 's' }\ni.a; i.b    // OK — everything is present\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> A = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">a</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attr\">shared</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> }\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> B = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">b</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attr\">shared</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">u</span>: A | B = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getSomething</span>()\nu.<span class=\"hljs-property\">shared</span>    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// OK — only the COMMON property is reachable</span>\nu.<span class=\"hljs-property\">a</span>         <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Error: it may be A or B</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">i</span>: A &amp; B = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">a</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;x&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">b</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">shared</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;s&#x27;</span> }\ni.<span class=\"hljs-property\">a</span>; i.<span class=\"hljs-property\">b</span>    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// OK — everything is present</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">To reach a union member's own property you must narrow first (<code>typeof</code>, <code>in</code>, a discriminated union).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Two intersection traits interviewers probe:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type Never = string &amp; number      // never — nothing is both a string and a number\n\ntype C = { x: string } &amp; { x: number }\n// x is never — no valid object can be built\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Never</span> = <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> &amp; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// never — nothing is both a string and a number</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> C = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">x</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> } &amp; { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">x</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span> }\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// x is never — no valid object can be built</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Practical pitfall:</strong> intersecting several large interfaces makes TypeScript's error messages long and hard to read.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">When you mean \"this object plus some fields\", <code>interface X extends Y</code> gives clearer errors than <code>type X = Y &amp; {...}</code>.</p>","references":[{"label":"TypeScript — Unions and intersection types","url":"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/2/everyday-types.html#union-types"},{"label":"TypeScript — Intersection types","url":"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/2/objects.html#intersection-types"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/321-typescript-la-gi-va-tai-sao-nen-dung-typescript-thay-javascript","title":"TypeScript là gì và tại sao nên dùng TypeScript thay JavaScript?"},{"url":"/q/322-type-annotation-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Type annotation trong TypeScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/323-any-unknown-va-never-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"any, unknown và never khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/325-literal-types-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Literal types trong TypeScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/327-type-narrowing-la-gi-cac-cach-narrow-type-trong-typescript","title":"Type narrowing là gì? Các cách narrow type trong TypeScript?"},{"url":"/q/328-as-keyword-type-assertion-la-gi-khi-nao-dung","title":"as keyword (type assertion) là gì? Khi nào dùng?"},{"url":"/q/329-non-null-assertion-operator-la-gi","title":"Non-null assertion operator (!) là gì?"},{"url":"/q/330-tuple-type-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Tuple type trong TypeScript là gì?"}]}